      "list_title": "以文传薪铸文脉 以智赋能启新程——吉林大学第二届文学周系列活动圆满落幕",
      "list_date": "2026-05-25",
      "response": {
        "url": "https://wxy.jlu.edu.cn/info/1039/20827.htm",
        "time": "2026-10-15T19:35:52+08:00",
        "ok": true,
        "final_url": "https://wxy.jlu.edu.cn/info/1039/20827.htm",
